# Cursor ARM Services Instructions

## First Steps

**READ THE README.md FIRST.** It contains essential documentation about:
- Project structure and file organization
- Component patterns (`locale`, `getFixedT`, `LandingHome`)
- SEO configuration and `// SEO:` markers (`astro.config.mjs`, Layout, `public/`)
- Legal pages use French slugs: `mentions-legales`, `politique-de-confidentialite`, `conditions-generales`. English copies (`/en/legal-notice`, `/en/privacy-policy`, `/en/terms-of-service`) exist only when `ENABLE_MULTILANG=true`
- Tailwind styling conventions, Armenian theme, and `global.css` animations

**Also read `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.project.md`, and `MULTILANG.md`.** `MULTILANG.md` is mandatory for languages, public URLs, slugs, and hreflang. Codex, Claude, Cursor, and GitHub Copilot use the same file.

## Content and Language

- Copy lives in **`src/i18n/locales/fr.json`** and **`en.json`**.
- Section components require **`locale: 'fr' | 'en'`**.
- **`publishedLocales`** in `src/site.config.ts` is `['fr']`. hreflang lists `fr` and `x-default` (the French URL) and never `en`. `ENABLE_MULTILANG=false` generates no `/en/` URL and hides the hero switcher. `true` generates `/en/` home and legal pages; hreflang still follows `publishedLocales`.
- ContentForge blocks are independent env flags, read at build time. On ARM Services all three stay `false`: `CONTENTFORGE_FAQ_ENABLED`, `CONTENTFORGE_REVIEWS_ENABLED`, `CONTENTFORGE_ARTICLES_ENABLED`. FAQ and reviews stay in i18n. `/blog` is not generated. A future `true` on articles generates `/blog` only for published locales (`/en/blog` only if `ENABLE_MULTILANG=true` and `en` is published). Hero, services, process, areas, legal pages, phone, and quote stay in this repo.

## SEO Markers

Look for `// SEO:` in `astro.config.mjs` when changing deployment URL or base path.

## Project Context

- Landing page for ARM Services, moving company based in Marseille
- Services: moving and delivery throughout France
- Target: individual and professional clients
- Conversion goal: phone calls and quote requests

## Key Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/site.config.ts` | Contact, social, SEO defaults |
| `astro.config.mjs` | Site URL and base path |
| `src/layouts/Layout.astro` | Meta, hreflang, JSON-LD, skip link |
| `src/pages/index.astro` | French home. English home is `src/pages/en/[...slug].astro`, only if `ENABLE_MULTILANG=true` |
| `src/components/LandingHome.astro` | Section composition |
| `src/i18n/locales/*.json` | All translatable strings |
| `src/styles/global.css` | Tailwind theme + animations |

## Component Pattern

```astro
---
import { getFixedT, type Locale } from '../i18n/i18n';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const t = getFixedT(locale);
---

<section class="..." aria-label={t('Section.aria')}>
</section>
```

## Tailwind CSS — STRICT RULES

### ✅ ALWAYS: Native Tailwind Classes Only

```astro
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4">
<button class="rounded-lg bg-orange-armenian hover:brightness-95">
```

### ❌ NEVER: Arbitrary Values (Brackets)

```astro
<!-- FORBIDDEN -->
<div class="w-[347px] text-[#1a2b3c]">
```

### ❌ NEVER: Inline Styles (except existing Quote CTA background-image)

```astro
<!-- FORBIDDEN -->
<div style="margin: 23px;">
```

### Animation Priority

1. Native Tailwind: `animate-pulse`, `animate-spin`, `animate-bounce`
2. Transitions: `transition-colors duration-200`
3. Existing: `fade-in`, `services-reveal` (in `global.css`)
4. New keyframes: Only if explicitly requested (include `prefers-reduced-motion`)

## Color Palette (Armenian Theme)

- **Orange**: `orange-armenian` (`#F2A800`) — Primary CTAs
- **Red**: `red-armenian` (`#D90012`) — Secondary accents
- **Blue**: `blue-armenian` (`#0033A0`) — Tertiary accents
- **Background**: `gray-900` (dark), `gray-100` (light)
- **Text**: `gray-900` (headings), `gray-600` (body)

## Conversion Focus

- Primary CTA: Phone call (`tel:` link)
- Secondary CTA: Quote request (`#devis`)
- Emphasize: reliability, insurance, professionalism
